  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 305.02 Variances Issued by State Fire Marshal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 305.02 Variances Issued by State Fire Marshal. Any AST system for which the state fire marshal has issued a variance to NFPA 30, NFPA 30A, or NFPA 31 standards shall be deemed as meeting both the requirements of Env-Or 305.01(c) and the portion of any standard listed in Env-Or 305.01(a) or (b) that specifies the same requirement as the one that has been waived.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Or 300) #10487, eff 2-7-14; ss by #14094, eff 10-4-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or300.html"
}
